sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Fact as Go WS / targeted hydration
participant Helix as Helix Projector
participant Composer as SurfaceComposer V2
participant Bus as Tauri opaque transport
participant Codec as Angular V2 Codec
participant Runtime as SurfaceRuntime
participant UI as 左侧会话列表

Fact->>Helix: 单频道绝对事实 + eventSeq
Helix->>Helix: 计算旧 section、目标 section 与相对锚点
Helix->>Helix: 构建 upsert/remove/move 和受影响 sectionPages
Helix->>Composer: dialog delta + paired unread replaceView
Composer->>Composer: 校验 scope/epoch/baseRevision/causation
Composer->>Bus: InteractionFrameV2
Bus->>Codec: opaque frame
Codec->>Codec: exact keys + operation bounds + anchor/window 校验
Codec->>Runtime: typed delta
Runtime->>Runtime: clone 受影响 section 并顺序应用 operations
Runtime->>Runtime: 校验唯一性、section、page 与 revision
alt 全部 slot 合法
  Runtime->>Runtime: dialog + unread 原子 swap
  Runtime->>UI: 只更新受影响 row/order
  Runtime-->>Composer: FrameApplied
else 任一校验失败
  Runtime-->>Runtime: 丢弃整帧并标记 resync-required
  Runtime-->>Helix: 请求 snapshot
end

Note over Helix,Runtime: 不允许 Angular 根据时间、置顶或关闭状态自行排序
Note over Composer,Runtime: paired unread 任一失败都不得部分提交
